close_reason: "Opt-in --dependency-updates adds a Dependencies section per release window from Dependabot-shaped git subjects in that window's tag range; item-less dependency-only windows get their version heading; output without the flag is byte-identical. npm run coverage: 505/505 tests, 100/100/100; npm run release:check exits 0; real pm-csv v2026.09.23 data renders the four bumps in both modes."
body: "Add opt-in --dependency-updates flag that reads git commits per window and collects Dependabot subjects into ### Dependencies. Companion: pm-cli-website-tbni"
